   "role": "agent",
   "text": "I've refunded your order, Isaac. I'm sorry it never got to you.\n\nThe delivery records confirm what the app told you. The courier picked up order K-6401 from Kaze Sushi at 6:25 PM and then abandoned it at 7:02 PM, so it was never delivered.\n\n**What I did:**\n- Refunded the full **$48.99** to your Visa ending in 4242. That covers the food, delivery fee, service fee and tip.\n- It should show up in **3\u20135 business days**.\n\n**About your statement:** You might also see a pending $48.99 authorization hold from when you placed the order. That hold has already been cancelled, so you're not being charged twice. It should disappear from your statement in 1\u20133 business days. The refund above cancels out the one real charge.\n\nCan I help with anything else?"
  },
