   "text": "You're welcome, Isaac. The refund is on record for order K-6401 (refund ID RF-4000): $48.99 to your Visa ending in 4242. It should arrive in 3\u20135 business days, and the cancelled hold should drop off in 1\u20133 business days.\n\nIf either one hasn't cleared after that, just message us and give that refund ID. Sorry again about tonight's sushi, and have a good evening!"
